{"suttaId":"ja146","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"Ja-i","vriCode":"s0513m.mul","paras":[816,819],"vripara":"146"},"segments":{"ja146:0.4":"Samuddakākajātakaṃ","ja146:1.1":"Api nu hanukā santā,","ja146:1.2":"mukhañca parisussati;","ja146:1.3":"Oramāma na pārema,","ja146:1.4":"pūrateva mahodadhīti.","ja146:2.1":"Samuddakākajātakaṃ chaṭṭhaṃ. 147."},"unsure":[],"preface":[],"attha":{"book":"Ja-a-i","bookName":"Jātaka-aṭṭhakathā-1","vriCode":"s0513a1.att","from":3048,"to":3048,"paras":[{"para":3048,"vripara":null,"refs":["ja146:1"],"lines":["Tattha <b>api nu hanukā santā</b>ti api no hanukā santā, api amhākaṃ hanukā kilantā.","<b>Oramāma na pāremā</b>ti mayaṃ attano balena mahāsamuddaudakaṃ ākaḍḍhāma osārema, tucchaṃ pana naṃ kātuṃ na sakkoma.","Ayañhi <b>pūrateva mahodadhī</b>ti."],"lineRefs":[["ja146:1"],["ja146:1"],["ja146:1"]]}],"wordLinks":[["ja146:1.1","api nu hanukā santā",0,0],["ja146:1.3","oramāma na pāremā",0,1],["ja146:1.3","pūrateva mahodadhī",0,2]]},"tika":{"book":"Ja-ṭ-i","bookName":"Jātaka-abhinavaṭīkā-1","vriCode":"","from":1439,"to":1441,"paras":[{"para":1439,"vripara":null,"refs":["ja146:1"],"lines":["6-samuddakākajātakavaṇṇanā (146)"],"lineRefs":[["ja146:1"]]},{"para":1440,"vripara":null,"refs":["ja146:1"],"lines":["<b>ramaṇīye</b>ti sādhujanānaṃ paṇḍitānaṃ manorame.","<b>vihārapariyante</b>ti vihārānaṃ paccante.","<b>yathā sannihita</b>nti yathā paṭisajjitaṃ.","<b>madhurahattharasā</b>ti sūpabyañjanānaṃ vidhāne atichekatāya madhurahattharasā.","<b>samuddadevatā</b>ti samudde ārakkhadevatā.","<b>nāgabalikamma</b>nti aravāḷādīnaṃ uragānaṃ balikammaṃ.","<b>ūmī</b>ti taraṅgo.","ūhanti vitakkenti etenāti ūmī.","ūha-vitakketi dhātu.","mī-paccayo.","ha-kāralopo cettha daṭṭhabbo.","katthaci pana potthakesu ummīti sasaṃyogapāṭho dissati.","dīghādivisaṃyogavasena pana pāṭho yeva icchitabbo.","<b>saṃcaritvā [khāditvā (chaṭṭha)] </b>ti saṃharitvā.","saṃkhipitvāti attho.","khāditvātipi pāṭho.","<b>idaṃ samuddodakaṃ nāma amhākaṃ kiṃ pahosī</b>ti idaṃ mahāsamudde udakaṃ nāma mahantampi amhākaṃ kena kāraṇena pahosi.","nappahosiyevāti attho.","<b>ussiñcitvā</b>ti uddhaṃ siñcitvā.","ukkhipitvāti attho.","<b>vissamantī</b>ti kilamathaṃ paṭivinodenti.","<b>dīnā</b>ti dukkhitā.","<b>api nu hanukā santā</b>ti ettha apisaddo ekaṃsatthe nipāto.","nusaddo pana padālaṅkāramatto.","<b>hanukā</b>ti hanuyeva hanukā.","hanati odanādīsu vaṇṇavisesaṃ nāsetīti hanu. hanuyeva sakatthe ka-paccayavasena hanukāti vuccati.","<b>santā</b>ti ettha samu-khedeti dhātussa vasena atthaṃ dasseti -- kilantāti iminā.","<b>corasamudda</b>nti osīdanavasena kākiyā māraṇato samuddo yeva coro viyāti coroti vuttoti."],"lineRefs":[["ja146:1"],["ja146:1"],["ja146:1"],["ja146:1"],["ja146:1"],["ja146:1"],["ja146:1"],["ja146:1"],["ja146:1"],["ja146:1"],["ja146:1"],["ja146:1"],["ja146:1"],["ja146:1"],["ja146:1"],["ja146:1"],["ja146:1"],["ja146:1"],["ja146:1"],["ja146:1"],["ja146:1"],["ja146:1"],["ja146:1"],["ja146:1"],["ja146:1"],["ja146:1"],["ja146:1"],["ja146:1"]]},{"para":1441,"vripara":null,"refs":["ja146:1"],"lines":["samuddakākajātakavaṇṇanā niṭṭhitā."],"lineRefs":[["ja146:1"]]}],"wordLinks":[]},"tika2":null}
